/E (Swiggy has been here before. In January 2025 it launched Snacc, a separate app promising snacks and quick bites in 10 to 15 minutes, starting in Bengaluru. Snacc was wound down within about a year. The parallel is not exact, and you should not pretend it is: Snacc was a speed bet, Toing is a price bet. But both were separate apps looking for economics that the main app could not provide. Whether Toing is the same mistake a second time or a different wager altogether is a question you will need to take a position on.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
